 "remarks": "Welcome to this spacious and well-maintained unit featuring an updated kitchen and beautiful hardwood flooring throughout the living and dining areas. The main level offers a convenient half bathroom, while the second floor features three bedrooms, one full bathroom and an additional half bathroom.  Enjoy the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer, along with plenty of surrounding greenery and outdoor space-perfect for walking and enjoying the neighborhood. Residents can also take advantage of an in-ground pool and playground. Conveniently located near shops, restaurants, schools, and city transportation, making everyday errands and commuting easy. Heat and water are included, along with two assigned parking spaces.  A wonderful combination of comfort, convenience, and amenities- ready to welcome you home!",
